#### Java Decision Table Evaluator

```java
public class DecisionTableEvaluator<C, A> {

    private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(DecisionTableEvaluator.class);
    private final DecisionTable<C, A> table;

    public DecisionTableEvaluator(DecisionTable<C, A> table) {
        this.table = table;
    }

    public List<A> evaluate(C context) {
        return table.rules().stream()
                .filter(rule -> rule.conditions().stream().allMatch(c -> c.isSatisfied(context)))
                .peek(rule -> log.info("tableId={} ruleId={} description={} outcome=Matched",
                        table.tableId(), rule.ruleId(), rule.description()))
                .map(DecisionRule::action)
                .collect(toList());
    }
}
```

