#### Principle 3: Audit Trace Validation

Include a test that verifies the audit trace is emitted with the expected fields when a rule fires. This is critical for regulatory compliance use cases.

```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task ExecuteAsync_RuleFires_EmitsAuditTrace()
{
    var auditLogger = new RecordingAuditLogger();
    var adapter = new RulesEngineAdapter(
        mockEngine, NullLogger<RulesEngineAdapter>.Instance, auditLogger);

    await adapter.ExecuteAsync("EligibilityWorkflow", new { IncomeFpl = 100 });

    Assert.Single(auditLogger.Traces);
    Assert.NotEmpty(auditLogger.Traces[0].InputHash);
    Assert.NotNull(auditLogger.Traces[0].RuleId);
}
